# content-structure

## Documentation Hierarchy
The content structure follows a domain-specific organization pattern:

Primary Sections:
- Getting Started
- Concepts
- Tags Reference
- Add-Ons
- Tutorials

Special "New" Documentation Sections:
- Sub-Templates
- Template Inheritance
- Custom Routes
- Extended Entities

Importance Score: 85
These sections represent core knowledge domains specific to CouchCMS functionality.

## Media Integration Structure
Media content follows specialized organization patterns:

1. Card-based content structure:
   - Base media cards (`src/components/card-media.astro`)
   - YouTube extensions (`src/components/card-youtube.astro`) 

2. Content hierarchy supports:
   - Linked vs. non-linked media presentations
   - Integrated video content
   - Standardized media aspect ratios

Importance Score: 45
While structured, these patterns primarily support standard documentation needs.

